    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d839">

                <pb facs="1626" n="1586" sameAs="frus:frus1952-54v09p1/pg1586"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">684A.85/7–154: Telegram</note>
                <head>No. 839<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in
                        Israel</hi><anchor n="1" xml:id="d839-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left"><hi rendition="#small-caps">confidential</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">niact</hi></seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1954-07-01T19:53:00-04:00">July 1, 1954—7:53
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1. Deliver following message Jordan (Israel) Government soonest: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>US Government has been informed widespread heavy firing broke out in
                            Jerusalem June 30<anchor n="2" xml:id="d839-f2"/> and has since
                            continued intermittently, reportedly having been resumed even after
                            agreement on cease fire reached at meeting Israel–Jordan Mixed Armistice
                            Commission July 1. US Government deplores this serious outbreak violence
                            in Holy City with attendant loss of life and urges Government Jordan
                            (Israel) take immediate steps insure observance cease fire. US
                            Government transmitting identical request Government Israel
                            (Jordan).</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dulles</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d839-f1" n="1" type="source" xml:id="d839-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to Amman niact, London, Paris, and Jerusalem, and by pouch to the Arab
                    capitals and New York.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d839-f2" n="2" xml:id="d839-f2-content">
                <p>Reports concerning the outbreak of firing in Jerusalem were contained in
                    telegrams 1 and 3 from Jerusalem, 2 and 5 from Tel Aviv, and 1 from Amman, all
                    dated July 1. (684A.85/7–154)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
